From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 19/63] dns/udp: a socket per query, a query sent again while
 no answer came

A server reached without a proxy gets a socket of its own for each query, and a plain UDP query is
sent again while no answer has come.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  f37046c27 dns/udp: one socket per query for servers reached without a proxy
  39ce754d8 dns: retransmit plain UDP queries while no answer has come

Pdk-Feature: dns-udp
Pdk-Zone: core
Pdk-Layer: 03
